# Build an Augmented Reality (AR) Education Platform

You are building **{{app.name}}** — "{{app.tagline}}".

Deliver a playful, kid-safe AR learning platform for cross-platform use:
scan real books to unlock AR lessons, explore an interactive lesson library,
run virtual science labs, and earn quests and badges along the way. The web
shell must be responsive and accessible; native AR ({{ar.ios}} / {{ar.android}})
plugs in through the adapters below.

