## Feature requirements

Group into **core** (ship first), **enhanced**, and **advanced**.

### Core
1. Responsive AR education platform for cross-platform delivery.
2. {{ar.ios}} and {{ar.android}} integration via the AR bridge.
3. Intuitive, child-friendly UI with consistent styling.
4. Reactive state management for efficient AR component rendering.
5. Secure auth with {{auth.provider}} and parental controls.
6. CMS for educators to create and upload AR lessons.
7. Interactive AR book scanner using {{cv.scanner}} to trigger content.
8. 3D object recognition for real-world learning experiences.
9. Real-time multiplayer AR sessions via {{networking.multiplayer}}.
10. Virtual lab system with realistic physics simulations.
11. AR language learning with object recognition and translation.
